<title>RUSSIA: Rouble lower at 5,376 per dlr in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble lower at 5,376 per dlr in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble edged down to 5,376 to the dollar on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange (MICEX) from 5,373 on Wednesday. Dealers said the central bank sold $0.33 million to close trading.</p>
<p>				    Sept 12		 Sept 11</p>
<p> Dollar rate			 5,376		   5,373</p>
<p> Volume traded (million $)	7.85		    13.95</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
